  .who
    %h5 who we are
    %h1
      We are a creative and engineering studio led by Jon and Jess. 
      We solve business problems through design, storytelling, and code.
    %h2
      Our founders met in 2014 while working on the Growth Team at Uber
      and have since teamed up to help other companies build their products, grow their brands,
      and inspire their customers.

  .us
    .one
      .shot.him
        .overlay
      %h1 Jon 
      %h5 Left brain
      %p 
        Jon was born in Paris and grew up in Montreal where he studied Finance.
        He hated it, so he moved to San Francisco to become an engineer.
        He spent over 4 years at Uber, building and scaling growth systems,
        enabling the company to onboard hundreds of thousands of drivers per week across hundreds of countries.
        When not writing code, you can find Jon playing League of Legends, supporting Paris Saint-Germain
        or cooking a mean coq au vin. Often all at the same time.
        Jess wanted me to add some text here it's as long as hers. I don't think she has noticed yet!
    .one
      .shot.her
        .overlay
      %h1 Jess 
      %h5 Right brain
      %p 
        Jess is a San Francisco native with a background in art direction, design and creative leadership.
        Prior to co-founding Jon&Jess, she built and led Uber's creative team in Amsterdam
        and was a lead designer on Uber's Growth Team in San Francisco. Before joining Uber,
        she served as an art director (and in-house dog sitter) at a long roster of ad agencies
        including CP+B (Ad Age's Agency of the Decade) and Evolution Bureau.
        Outside Jon&Jess, Jess is an enthusiastic dog mom,
        serial hobbyist and founder of the learn-for-leisure lecture series The Social Study.

